description

Soccer Bot is a high-performance four-wheel robot built for competitive soccer matches.
Designed to compete against other powerful robots, it emphasizes power, durability, and precise control.
It uses 500 RPM geared motors, metal wheels, an ESP32 controller, and BTS7960 motor drivers for strong, responsive movement.
The aluminum frame provides a durable yet lightweight foundation.
This project combines mechanical engineering, electronics, wireless control, and software for a reliable, competition-ready soccer robot.


